n FPL? Let's talk about it.\n\nLast seasons rank = 588th!\n\nBest 5 ranks = 588, 1294, 4935, 8492, 9975.\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🙏 Subscribe: https://bit.ly/SubLTFPL\n👍 Follow me: https://linktr.ee/letstalkfpl\n💪 Become a channel member: https://bit.ly/LTFPLYTMember\n📩 Business Inquiries: andy@letstalkfpl.com \n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nJoin my league 👉 glojzb\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n00:00 Intro\n00:18 Szoboszlai\n07:25 Calvert-Lewin\n11:20 Not enough hype about Saka\n13:39 Not valuing DEFCON\n18:14 Not really considering Gabriel\n21:26 Van Dijk is being overlooked\n23:38 Pushing early Bench Boost too much\n29:10 You're overrating Pascal Groß\n31:01 Not thinking about Sangaré enough\n33:18 Overrating Harry Maguire\n35:15 Not giving Isak enough thought\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3O8rsWchEM0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDGQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AbgC9xg=\u0026rs=AOn4CLCyHq_EUlY9uGPXMalOLUliBEwvQA","width":168,"height":94},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3O8rsWchEM0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDGQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AbgC9xg=\u0026rs=AOn4CLAS0sozA7pd27BwRO6v6I7XVYrbmA","width":196,"height":110},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3O8rsWchEM0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAG4AvcY\u0026rs=AOn4CLC5eZmo7ZxkPW2GrEhaWEniOZmjZQ","width":246,"height":138},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3O8rsWchEM0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCNACELwBSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAG4AvcY\u0026rs=AOn4CLC-gC3eo2DMxZgKD54K3g2nOM_9LA","width":336,"height":188},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/3O8rsWchEM0/maxresdefault.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}]},"allowRatings":true,"viewCount":"88661","author":"Let's Talk FPL","isPrivate":false,"isUnpluggedCorpus":false,"isLiveContent":false,"isTvfilmVideo":false},"annotations":[{"playerAnnotationsExpandedRenderer":{"featuredChannel":{"startTimeMs":"5000","endTimeMs":"2244000","watermark":{"thumbnails":[{"ur