4287951860,"invertedBackground":4285721837,"overlayBackground":3422764093},"colorSampledDescriptionBodyText":{"content":"Gillette are campaigning to bring back the iconic shirt off celebration and I support it. Click the link here https://www.gillette.co.uk/c/shirt-of...  to sign the petition! #ad\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nWhat am I wrong about in FPL? Let's talk about it.\n\nLast seasons rank = 588th!\n\nBest 5 ranks = 588, 1294, 4935, 8492, 9975.\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🙏 Subscribe: https://bit.ly/SubLTFPL\n👍 Follow me: https://linktr.ee/letstalkfpl\n💪 Become a channel member: https://bit.ly/LTFPLYTMember\n📩 Business Inquiries: andy@letstalkfpl.com \n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nJoin my league 👉 glojzb\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n00:00 Intro\n00:18 Szoboszlai\n07:25 Calvert-Lewin\n11:20 Not enough hype about Saka\n13:39 Not valuing DEFCON\n18:14 Not really considering Gabriel\n21:26 Van Dijk is being overlooked\n23:38 Pushing early Bench Boost too much\n29:10 You're overrating Pascal Groß\n31:01 Not thinking about Sangaré enough\n33:18 Overrating Harry Maguire\n35:15 Not giving Isak enough thought\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":110,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBQQ040EGAciEwif_6WD9quWAxX4afIAHRQ1M7tIzaGEuZb2yvfcAcoBBAhnvOI=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUllqSVBZZElILVpxY1dtSF8yUGtSanxBR3JiS2Ftd1dVNUlhUFJ6cDdpcW1GOGxkcmtPNnN5Qnc5bTI3alhNeGM2akQ2VUIxSEpTVzFDNnVvNWFwZ1lIN3FzeDUxamx1ZUVxTXVCV2tRX2d1UXlVWmMyZWxVNFhBZTl5\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.gillette.co.uk%2Fc%2Fshirt-off-celebration-petition%2F\u0026v=3O8rsWchEM0","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUllqSVBZZElILVpxY1dtSF8yUGtSanxBR3JiS2Ftd1dVNUlhUFJ6cDdpcW1GOGxkcmtPNnN5Qnc5bTI3alhNeGM2akQ2VUIxSEpTVzFDNnVvNWFwZ1lIN3FzeDUxamx1ZUVxTXVCV2tRX2d1UXlVWmM